<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="COL" style="id">KOR - Kuturikihwa kwoBhaibhiri muchiKorekore</book>
  <para style="h">VaKorose</para>
  <para style="toc1">Tsamba raPhauro kuvaKorose</para>
  <para style="toc2">VaKorose</para>
  <para style="toc3">Vako</para>
  <para style="mt2">Tsamba raPhauro</para>
  <para style="mt1">kuVAKOROSE</para>
  <para style="imt">Kuwidzira</para>
  <para style="ip">Tsamba kuVaKorose ridonyorewa noNhumwa Phauro (VaKorose 1:1). Adonyora tsamba rakareri paanga ari mutorongo, zvichida ari muRoma, kumakore makumi matanhatu mumasure mokuzvahwa kwaKhirisitu. VaKorose, pabodzi noVaEfeso uye naFirimoni yanodaidziwa kuti matsamba yomutorongo nokuda kwokuti Phauro adoyanyora paanga ari mutorongo. Adonyora tsamba rakareri kukherekhe yanga iri muguta roKorose. Phauro ndiyeba adothanga kherekhe muKorose, sezvaanonyaira muchitsauko 2:1, asi anofanira kunge adonzvawo kuva nobasa nokuda kwayene, zvinofungidzihwa kuti adoithanga ndiEpafurasi ndava waibva kuKorose.</para>
  <para style="ip">Phauro wanga achitsutsumwa nokuda kwodzidziso yomabhwodo yanga iri mukherekhe yopaKorose. Adopedza nguwa idowanda mutsamba achinyora pamusoro payene. Panogona kuva noboka rovaKhirisitu vaiva maJudha vanga vaakuedza kumanikidza vabiyavo kutevera mitemo yochiJudha yomuChibvumirano Chokare, kunyanya yokuchecheudziwa. Phauro anonyora achibiritsa pachenu kuti maKhirisitu hapanai chinhu chavanoda kana umwe wavanoda kunze kwaKhirisitu basi kuti vatambiriwe naMwari (vaKorose 1:15-20) uye kuti dzidziso dzidozendamira pakuziva kwomunhu hadzinai nokabonyo kese (vaKorose 2:8)</para>
  <para style="iot">Marongehwo</para>
  <para style="io1">Phauro anothanga tsamba nokumoresa kherekhe iri muKorose (vaKorose 1:1-2)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ndokudzonyora pamusoro poukuru hwaKhirisitu kunyanya mukupindura adonangana nodzidziso yomabhwodo yanga iri muKorose (VaKorose1:3—3:4).</para>
  <para style="io1">Sezvinowanika mutsamba dzaPhauro dzizinji, anopedza chidimbu chinotevera chotsamba achipasa kuraira kudonangana nokurarama kudonaka kwochiKhirisitu (vaKorose 3:54-6).</para>
  <para style="io1">Phauro anopedzisa nokumoresa uye nokuraira kuti tsamba riverengewe zvinonzvika kuno yamwe makherekhe (vaKorose 4:7-18).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="COL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 1:1" />Phauro, Nhumwa yaKhirisitu Jesu nokuda kwaMwari, naTimoti hama yedu.<verse eid="COL 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 1:2" />Kuvatsvene nohama dzidotendeka muna Khirisitu vari paKorose.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="COL 1:2">Mutsa norunyararo zvinobva kunaMwari Baba vedu mbazvive kwamuri.<verse eid="COL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Munamato woKutenda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 1:3" />Tinotenda Mwari nguwa dzese, ivo Baba vaIshe wedu Jesu Khirisitu, patinokunamatirai, <verse eid="COL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 1:4" />nokuti tidonzva zvokutenda kwenyu muna Khirisitu Jesu uye norudo ramunaro kuvatsvene vese, <verse eid="COL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 1:5" />nokuda kwotariro yamudochengetehwa kudenga. Iyo yamudonzva kare mushoko rochokwadi, rovhangeri, <verse eid="COL 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 1:6" />ridouya kwamuri. Fanike zvaridoitawo munyika yese. Kubva pazuva ramudonzva nokunzvitsitsa mutsa waMwari muchokwadi, vhangeri riri kubereka zvibereko richipararira pakati penyu. <verse eid="COL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 1:7" />Sezvamudodzidza kubva kuna Epafurasi muranda anodikana pabodzi naisisu. Iye mushumiri adotendeka waKhirisitu adotimiririra <verse eid="COL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 1:8" />uye iye adotiudza zvorudo renyu muMweya.<verse eid="COL 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 1:9" />Saka naisisuwo kubva pazuva ratidonzva nozvenyu, hatinai kumira kukunamatirai, tichikumbira kuti muzaziwe nokuziva maninge kuda kwache pakuchenjera kwese kwopamweya nokunzvitsitsa, <verse eid="COL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 1:10" />kuti murarame sezvinodiwa naIshe, muchimufadza panozvese, muchibereka zvibereko mubasa rese ridonaka nokuingidzika mukuziva Mwari. <verse eid="COL 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 1:11" />Simbisiwai nosimba rese, maererano nosimba rokubhwinya kwache, nokuda kwokutsungirira kwese nomwoyo murefu, mova nomufaro, <verse eid="COL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 1:12" />muchipasa kutenda kuna Baba, adokuitai kuti muve vadokodzera kukovehwa nhaka yovatsvene muchiedza choumambo. <verse eid="COL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 1:13" />Iye adotisunungura kubva pamasimba yorima ndokutiisa muumambo hwoMwanakomana wache waanoda. <verse eid="COL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 1:14" />maari tinorudzikinuro, iko kurekerehwa zvitema.<verse eid="COL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Khirisitu noBasa Rache</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 1:15" />Khirisitu ndiye mufananidzo waMwari asingaoneke, ndiye dangwe rozvisikwa zvese, <verse eid="COL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 1:16" />nokuti maari zvinhu zvese zvidosikiwa, zviri kudenga nozviri panyika, zvinooneka nozvisingaoneke, zvingave mipando youshe kana ushe kana vatongi kana vanomasimba. Zvinhu zvese zvidosikiwa kuburikidza naye uye zvidosikihwa iye. <verse eid="COL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 1:17" />Ndiye anothangira zvinhu zvese, uye maari zvinhu zvese zvidobatana pabodzi. <verse eid="COL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 1:18" />Iye ndiye musoro womuviri, ndiyo kherekhe; ndiye wokuthanga, dangwe kubva kuvadopfa, kuti muzvinhu zvese iye ave mukuru. <verse eid="COL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 1:19" />Nokuti Mwari adofara nazvo kuti kuzara kwache kwese kugare maari, <verse eid="COL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 1:20" />uye kuti naye ayananise zvinhu zvese kwaari, zvingave zviri panyika kana zviri kudenga, achiita runyararo nogazi rache ridodeuhwa pamuchinjikwa.<verse eid="COL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 1:21" />Naimimiwo, kare manga muri varendo novapanduki mupfungwa dzenyu, nondava yomabasa yenyu yadoipa, <verse eid="COL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 1:22" />asi manje adokuyananisai mumuviri wache wonyama nokupfa kwache, kuti akuisei pamberi pache muri vatsvene musinai mhosva kana chamunganenedzehwe, <verse eid="COL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 1:23" />ndokunge marambira pakutenda, mudogadzikana nokumira mudosimba, musingabiritsiwe patariro yovhangeri ramudonzva, ridoparidzihwa zvisikwa zvese pasi podenga, iro randidoitiwa mushumiri warene inipano, Phauro.<verse eid="COL 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Basa raPhauro seMuranda woKherekhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 1:24" />Zvino ndinofara mukutambudzika kwangu nokuda kwenyu, uye mumuviri wangu ndinozazisa zvidosara pamatambudziko yaKhirisitu nokuda kwomuviri wache, ndiyo kherekhe, <verse eid="COL 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 1:25" />inova yandidoitiwa mushumiri wayene maererano nobasa raMwari randidopasiwa nokuda kwenyu, kuti shoko raMwari rizikane zvidozara. <verse eid="COL 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="COL 1:26" />ndicho chidosvisvika changa chidosvisviwa kubva pakuthanga kwonguwa nokwomarudzi asi zvino chidoratidziwa kuvatsvene vache. <verse eid="COL 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="COL 1:27" />Kunovakarevo Mwari adosarudza kuzivisa kukura kwoupfumi hwokubhwinya kwochidosvisvika chakarechi pakati povasiri vaJudha, chokuti Khirisitu mukati menyu, ndiye tariro yokubhwinya. <verse eid="COL 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="COL 1:28" />Iye ndiye watinoparidza, tichichenjedza munhu wese nokudzidzisa munhu umwe noumwe nouchenjeri hwese, kuti tiise munhu umwe noumwe muna Khirisitu ari mukuru zvidozara. <verse eid="COL 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="COL 1:29" />Nokuda kwozvakarezvi ndinotambudzika, nokushingirira nosimba rese raanondisimbisa naro mukati mangu.<verse eid="COL 1:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="COL 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 2:1" />Nokuti ndinoda kuti muzive kuti ndinokutamburirai zvikuru sei, uye noavo vari kuRaodhisiya, novese vasati vandiona, <verse eid="COL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 2:2" />kuti mwoyo yavo ikurudzihwe uye vabatanidziwe murudo, vave nopfuma yese yokunzvitsitsa nokuziva chidosvisvika chaMwari, anova Khirisitu. <verse eid="COL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 2:3" />Maari ndimo mudovikhiwa pfuma yese yokuchenjera noruzivo.<verse eid="COL 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 2:4" />Ndinonyaira zvakarezvi kuti pareke kuva nomunhu anokufurirai nomashoko yomabhwodo. <verse eid="COL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 2:5" />Nokuti kana zvazvene ndisipo nomuviri, asi ndiripo pabodzi naimipa pamweya, ndinofara kuona kunzvanana kwenyu nokusimba kwokutenda kwenyu muna Khirisitu.<verse eid="COL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuzara kwoUpenyu muna Khirisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 2:6" />Naizvozvo sezvamudogamuchira Khirisitu Jesu saIshe, nokudaro raramai maari, <verse eid="COL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 2:7" />muno midzi yenyu nokuvakiwa maari uye nokusimbisiwa pakutenda, sezvamudodzidzisiwa, muchinyanya kutenda.<verse eid="COL 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 2:8" />Onai kuti hapanai munhu anokufurirai nouchenjeri uye nomashoko yanokunyengedza kusinai nomaturo yese, achitevera tsika dzovanhu, maererano nozvomavambo yomweya yonyika ino zvisiri zvaKhirisitu. <verse eid="COL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 2:9" />Nokuti maari kuzara kwese kwoumwari kunogara mumuviri, <verse eid="COL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 2:10" />uye imimi mudouyisiwa kukuzara kwoupenyu maari, iye musoro woutongi hwese nomasimba.<verse eid="COL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 2:11" />Maari pakare mudochecheudziwa nokuchecheudziwa kusinai kuitiwa nomanja, kwokubiritsiwa kwonyama yomuviri kuri kuchecheudziwa kunoitiwa naKhirisitu, <verse eid="COL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 2:12" />uye mudovigiwa pabodzi naye muruombeko, mamudomutsiwawo pabodzi naye kuburikidza nokutenda kwenyu musimba raMwari, adomumutsa kubva kuvadopfa. <verse eid="COL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 2:13" />Manje imimi, manga mudopfa mukutadza kwenyu nopakusaya kuchecheudziwa kwomiviri yenyu, Mwari adokuitai vapenyu pabodzi naKhirisitu. Adotirekerera kutadza kwedu kwese, <verse eid="COL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 2:14" />adodzima gwaro ranga richitihwisa pazvirevo zvarene zvaidiwa nomutemo, zvakarezvi adoribiritsa ndokuriisa parutivi, achirirovera pamuchinjikwa. <verse eid="COL 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 2:15" />Adotorera zvombo vatongi novanomasimba achivanyadzisa pachena, achivakunda kuburikidza nomuchinjikwa.<verse eid="COL 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 2:16" />Nokudaro mbakureke kuva nomunhu anokupasai mhosva pamusoro pozvokuja kana zvokumwa kana nokuda kwomutambo kana mutambo wokugara kwomwedzi kana wosabata. <verse eid="COL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 2:17" />Zvakarezvi mumvuri basi wozvichauya, asi chokwadi ndiKhirisitu. <verse eid="COL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 2:18" />Mbapareke kuva noanokutorerai kodzero yenyu, achikusukumidzirai kuzvininipisa kwomabhwodo nokunamata ngirozi, achitsamira panozvaadoona, achizvikudza zvisinai nomaturo yese kuri kufunga kwovanhu, <verse eid="COL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 2:19" />adotayana noMusoro, nokuti kubva pauri muviri wese unosimbisiwa nokubatanidziwa pabodzi nomapfundo yawene nomidzira, ndokukura nokukurisiwa kunobva kuna Mwari.<verse eid="COL 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupfa Nokurarama naKhirisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 2:20" />Manje kana mudopfa naKhirisitu kuzvinhu zvokuthanga zvomweya zvonyika, ndava yei muchirarama kunge muchiri vomunyika? Munozviisireiko pasi pomitemo, <verse eid="COL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 2:21" />“Reka kubata, reka kuraidza, reka kugwama?” <verse eid="COL 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 2:22" />Zvinhu zvakarezvi zvese zvinoparara pazvinoshandisiwa, ndava mirairo nodzidziso dzovanhu. <verse eid="COL 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 2:23" />Mitemo yakarei idoita kunge inouchenjeri pakuoneka kwayene pakunamata kwomabhwodo nokuzvidukupisa nokutambudza muviri, asi hazvinai simba rokukunda kuchiva kwonyama.<verse eid="COL 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="COL 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 3:1" />Zvino kana mudomutsiwa pabodzi naKhirisitu, tsvagai zvinhu zviri kumusoro, kuna Khirisitu, adogarikika kujanja roruji raMwari. <verse eid="COL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 3:2" />Fungai zviri kumusoro, aikona kuzvinhu zviri panyika. <verse eid="COL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 3:3" />Nokuti mudopfa, uye upenyu hwenyu hudovikhiwa pabodzi naKhirisitu muna Mwari. <verse eid="COL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 3:4" />Kana Khirisitu iye anova upenyu hwedu paachaoneka, pakarepo naimimiwo muchaoneka pabodzi naye mukubhwinya.<verse eid="COL 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Upenyu hwoKare noHutsva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 3:5" />Naizvozvo bayai zvinhu zvomunyika zviri mamuri zvinoti: upombwe, notsambwa, nokuchiva, nokuda zvidoipa, nonhafu ndiko kunamata zvifananidzo. <verse eid="COL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 3:6" />Nokuda kwozvakarezvi ukari hwaMwari huri kuuya. <verse eid="COL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 3:7" />Zvinhu izvozvi imimi maimbofamba mazviri kare, pamairarama mazviri.<verse eid="COL 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 3:8" />Asi manje biritsai zvese zvinoti: ukari, kugumbuka, kuzonda, kutukana, nokutaura zvidofumuka nomuromo wenyu. <verse eid="COL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 3:9" />Rekai kubhwodokerana, nokuti mudobiritsa unhu hwokare nomabasa yahwene, <verse eid="COL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 3:10" />mudosimira munhu mutsva, ari kuvandudziwa pakuziva, kuti afanane noMusiki wache. <verse eid="COL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 3:11" />Pano hapachinai muGiriki nomuJudha, adochecheudziwa noasinai kuchecheudziwa, mutohwa kana nyamungu, muranda kana adosununguka, asi Khirisitu ndiye zvese, uye ari munovese.<verse eid="COL 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 3:12" />Nokudaro sevanhu vadosarudziwa naMwari, vatsvene novanodiwa, simirai mwoyo unotsitsi, unyoro, kuzvideredza, kupfava nomwoyo murefu, <verse eid="COL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 3:13" />muitirane mwoyo murefu, muchiregererana kana umwe watadzira umwe, sekuregerehwa kwamudoitiwa naIshe, naizvozvo munofanira kuregerera. <verse eid="COL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 3:14" />Uye pamusoro pozvakarezvi zvese simirai rudo, rinova iro rinobatanidza zvese pabodzi mukubatana kudokwana. <verse eid="COL 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 3:15" />Motendera rugare raKhirisitu kuti ritonge mumwoyo yenyu nokuti ndizvo zvamudodaidzihwa mumuviri mubodzi. Uye pasai kutenda. <verse eid="COL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 3:16" />Shoko raKhirisitu mbarigare mukati menyu noupfumi hwarene hwese, dzidzisanai nokurairana nouchenjeri hwese, uye nomapisarema nozvimbo zvomweya imbirai Mwari nokutenda mumwoyo yenyu. <verse eid="COL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 3:17" />Uye zvese zvamunoita, kana zviri zvoshoko kana basa, itai zvese muzita raIshe Jesu, muchitenda Mwari Baba kuburikidza naye.<verse eid="COL 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukama muUpenyu Hutsva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 3:18" />Vakadzi, zviisei pasi povarume venyu sezvinofanira muna Ishe.<verse eid="COL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 3:19" />Varume, idai vakadzi venyu, rekai kuvaitira ukari.<verse eid="COL 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 3:20" />Vana, teererai vabereki venyu muzvinhu zvese nokuti ndizvo zvinofadza Ishe.<verse eid="COL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 3:21" />Madzibaba, rekai kugumbura vana venyu, kuitira kuti vareke kuwodzewa mwoyo.<verse eid="COL 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 3:22" />Varanda, teererai atenzi venyu vopanyika pazvinhu zvese, rekai kundoshanda chete pamunenge muchionewa kunge vafadzi vovanhu, asi zviitei nomwoyo udorurama, muchicha Ishe. <verse eid="COL 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 3:23" />Zvese zvamunoita shandai nomwoyo wese, semuri kushandira Ishe musingaitire vanhu, <verse eid="COL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 3:24" />muchiziva kuti kubva kunaIshe muchapasiwa mubairo wonhaka ndava ndiIshe Khirisitu wamuri kushandira. <verse eid="COL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 3:25" />Nokuti anoita zvidoipa achapasiwa zvidoipa zvaadoita, uye hapanai rusaruro.<verse eid="COL 3:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="COL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 4:1" />Anatenzi, batai varanda venyu zvabhwino uye zvidofanira, muchiziva kuti naimimiwo muna Tenzi ari kudenga.<verse eid="COL 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rairiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 4:2" />Rambai muchishingirira pakunamata, muchigara pakuri nokutenda, <verse eid="COL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 4:3" />uye mutinamatirewo isisu kuti Mwari atipase mukana woshoko, kuti tizivise chidosvisvika chaKhirisitu, chinova chandidosungihwa, <verse eid="COL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 4:4" />kuti ndichiise pachenu sezvandinofanira.<verse eid="COL 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 4:5" />Zvichenjererei pamugariro wenyu novasingatende, shandisai mukana wenyu zvidochenjera. <verse eid="COL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 4:6" />Kunyaira kwenyu mbakuve nomutsa nguwa dzese, kunobuya kuitira kuti muzive kuti munofanira kupindura tini umwe noumwe.<verse eid="COL 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumoresana kwoKupedzisira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 4:7" />Tikikasi achakunyepai pamusoro pozvese zviri kuitika kwandiri, iye ihama yatinoda uye mushumiri adotendeka nomuranda pabodzi nainipano muna Ishe. <verse eid="COL 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 4:8" />Ndamutuma kwamuri nochinangwa chakarechi, chokuti muzive kuti tiri tini, uye kuti akurudzire mwoyo yenyu, <verse eid="COL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 4:9" />pabodzi naOnesimosi, hama idotendeka inodiwa, anova umwe wenyu. Ivo vachakunyepai zvese zviri kuitika kwakarekuno.<verse eid="COL 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 4:10" />Arisitakasi musungwa biyangu anokumoresai, naMariko hama yaBhanabhasi wamudonyepewa pamusoro pache, kana wauya kwamuri mutambirei, <verse eid="COL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 4:11" />naJesu anodaidziwa kuti Jusito. Vakareva ndivo basi varume vochiJudha pakati povashandi biyangu voumambo hwaMwari, ivo vanondinyaradza.<verse eid="COL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 4:12" />Epafurasi, anova mabiyenyu, muranda waKhirisitu Jesu, anokumoresai, anoramba achikuyeukai chaizvo nguwa dzese muminyengetero yache, kuti mumire mudosimba muchiziva chaizvo kuda kwaMwari. <verse eid="COL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 4:13" />Nokuti ndinopfakaza kuti adoshanda nosimba nokuda kwenyu novari muRaodhisiya nomuHiraporisi. <verse eid="COL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 4:14" />Ruka chiremba anodiwa naDhimasi vanokumoresai.<verse eid="COL 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 4:15" />Ndimoresereiwo hama dziri paRaodhisiya, naNimufa nokherekhe iri mumba mache. <verse eid="COL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 4:16" />Futi kana tsamba rakareri raverengewa pakati penyu, mbariverengewewo pakamu mukherekhe yopaRaodhisiya, uye onai kuti maverengawo tsamba rinobva kuRaodhisiya. <verse eid="COL 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 4:17" />Nyepai Akipasi muchiti, “Ona kuti wazazisa ushumiri hwaudopasiwa naIshe nokuhupedzisa.” <verse eid="COL 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 4:18" />Inipano, Phauro ndanyora nojanja rangu kumoresa kwakareku. Yeukai kusungiwa kwangu. Mutsa mbauve nemi.<verse eid="COL 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 4" />
</usx>